      <author>David Barron</author>
    </note-attributes>
    <content>
      <![CDATA[<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8" standalone="no"?>
<!DOCTYPE en-note SYSTEM "http://xml.evernote.com/pub/enml2.dtd">
<en-note><div>Solo on the VT track, 10:30am, 41F, light wind on the back straight.</div><div><br/></div><div><b>4:52.8</b> (73.1 / 73.6 / 74.2 / 71.9)</div><div><br/></div><ul><li>Warmup 20' easy + drills + 4 strides.</li><li>Lap 3 slump as usual. Didn't have the gear change I used to.</li><li>HR max 194, avg last 2 laps 189.</li><li>College PR 4:14. Not the point anymore, but faster than December (4:58).</li></ul><div><br/></div><div>Takeaway: aerobic base is clearly better (lap 4 was the fastest), top-end speed is gone. That's expected and fine. Strides 2x/week stay in.</div></en-note>]]>
    </content>
  </note>
</en-export>
